Z||000000||pherder||05-07-2000||07:00 PM||||I am getting closer to getting the HO Quad 4 Coupe running.<P>Put the 88 Gold GT wheels on the car to see how it looks and then pushed it outside to wash one year of dust/grime off of it. <P>Thought I would take a couple of pictures while I was at it.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=208525&a=1537447&p=20813969&Sequence=0">  <BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=208525&a=1537447&p=20813971&Sequence=0"> <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=208525&a=1537447&p=20813974&Sequence=0">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=208525&a=1537447&p=20813976&Sequence=0">  <P>Enjoy.<p>[This message has been edited by pherder (edited 05-07-2000).]||||reg||1
