Z||000006||pherder||05-08-2000||06:35 PM||||Okay!  Okay!!!<P>Here is some pictures of the HO Quad 4!!<P>Before install ...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=208525&a=1537447&p=15272714&Sequence=0"> <BR>After install ...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=208525&a=1537447&p=17097105&Sequence=2"> <P>I did my own swap since there isn't really a kit for the 88s.<P>You can see some of the other projects that may or may not be finished at:<P> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=208525" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=208525</A> <P>Paul (I'm feeling much better, now)<P>||||reg||1
